        },
        {
          "text": "“No meddling,” I warned out loud",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3608
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Suddenly, the glow of the lights slowed, the sputtering of stalling machinery erupted along the road, and they all stopp",
